ses and all needed for  Pandora  then we have Generation 4 or The  Offspring hybrids which although are not  avatars since they have their own  Consciousness and were born from a navi  still have quite a few human traits as  they have a tiny bit of human DNA in  their cells these were the children of  Jake and natiri as well as the solo Kiri  so I hope you have enjoyed watching this  video and do hit the like button for  support as well as subscribe but most of  all smash the Bell icon for regular  updates on new videos right here on this  channel till the next one take care fam

